    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***BONEBUILDER IS CURRENTLY IN ALPHA***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***Current version includes 1 boss and 10-30 minutes of gameplay***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the small indie studio Vector Warrior comes their first game BONEBUILDER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike you will fight imposing enemies in heavy, deliberate third-person 3D action combat. Defeated enemies may offer their weapons or one of their bones, the latter which can be attached to your own body and granting access to build-defining upgrades to your character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may perish many times on your journey, but with each death comes new knowledge and sometimes the unravelling of new paths through the world so that each attempt at beating the game will feel unique.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***BONEBUILDER IS CURRENTLY IN ALPHA***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***Current version includes 1 boss and 10-30 minutes of gameplay***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the small indie studio Vector Warrior comes their first game BONEBUILDER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike you will fight imposing enemies in heavy, deliberate third-person 3D action combat. Defeated enemies may offer their weapons or one of their bones, the latter which can be attached to your own body and granting access to build-defining upgrades to your character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may perish many times on your journey, but with each death comes new knowledge and sometimes the unravelling of new paths through the world so that each attempt at beating the game will feel unique.</p>",
    "short_description": "A roguelike about building the biggest and baddest skeleton to take on challenging bosses. Gather bones and weapons from defeated enemies to change the way your character moves and attacks.",
